      "stageRecord": "The DP bearing the supplementary relative raises from its established matrix Spec-VP position to Spec-IP, leaving a silent DP trace. The supplement remains attached to DP and is carried with it; no extraposition is required. The matrix verb then raises from V to I and leaves a silent head trace. Finite I assigns nominative Case to the raised subject and agrees with its third-person masculine singular features. The subject chain preserves the theme role assigned in the lower position. The final structure therefore means that the independently identified man left, with the supplementary information that the speaker saw him. The existing joint realizations remain unchanged, and the pronounced terminals yield exactly האיש שראיתי אותו הלך.",
